Track separate timers:

```text
receive_lag_ms
webhook_ack_ms
queue_wait_ms
handler_total_ms
first_send_ms
db_ms and db_query_count
model_ms and model_call_count
transcribe_ms
provider_send_ms
provider_delivery_ms
merchant_acknowledgement_ms
```

Track p50, p95, and p99 by:

```text
turn kind: tap/text/voice/location
route
language
vendor
zone
function region
model used
provider
cache hit/miss
```

Recommended starting SLOs:

| Operation | p50 target | p95 target |
|---|---:|---:|
| webhook acknowledgement | <300 ms | <800 ms |
| button handler before send | <700 ms | <1.5 s |
| deterministic text | <1.2 s | <2.5 s |
| AI first acknowledgement | <1 s | <2 s |
| AI final response | <3 s | <5 s |
| merchant notification enqueue | <300 ms | <800 ms |
| payment status reconciliation | async | provider-specific |
| menu page read | <200 ms | <500 ms |

The exact WhatsApp delivery time should be measured separately from Alo King handler time.

## Alert conditions

Alert when:

```text
button p95 > 1.5 s
webhook ack p95 > 800 ms
db query count rises unexpectedly
cache hit rate drops
model calls per simple turn > 0
AI cost per order rises
notification queue age rises
provider retry rate rises
payment reconciliation lags
```

